{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40687","headline":"叙事寄荐福栖白 · 李洞","name":"叙事寄荐福栖白","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"险倚石屏风，秋涛梦越中。\n前朝吟会散，故国讲流终。\n北地闻巴狖，南山见碛鸿。\n楼高惊雨阔，木落觉城空。\n兔满期姚监，蝉稀别楚公。\n净缾光照客，拄杖朽生虫。\n平地塔千尺，半空灯一笼。\n祝尧谈几句，旋泻海涛东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}